            "raw_output": "/home/jovyan/adi_wdir/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/sf_triggers/:\ntotal 1504\ndrwxr-sr-x. 11 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 19:31 .\ndrwxr-sr-x.  4 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 14:02 ..\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 14:38 .ipynb_checkpoints\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users 1338949 Sep 14 19:04 0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users   22500 Sep 14 14:02 1_baseline_template.ipynb\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users   26704 Sep 14 14:02 2_finetune_template_1D.ipynb\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users   12975 Sep 14 14:02 3_finetune_template_1D.py\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users   16598 Sep 14 14:02 ADAPTING.md\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users   31366 Sep 14 14:02 A_shapes_and_broadcasting.ipynb\ndrwxr-sr-x.  3 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 17:55 assets\ndrwxr-sr-x.  3 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 18:49 configs\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users    2493 Sep 14 14:02 configs.py\ndrwxr-sr-x.  3 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 19:28 data\ndrwxr-sr-x.  4 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 19:19 datasets\n-rwxr-xr-x.  1 jovyan users     471 Sep 14 14:02 download_scalers.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x.  1 jovyan users     516 Sep 14 14:02 download_scalers_and_weights.sh\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 14:02 lightning_modules\ndrwxr-sr-x.  3 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 19:02 logs\ndrwxr-sr-x.  3 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 18:34 metrics\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users    4096 Sep 14 14:02 models\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users    2290 Sep 14 18:24 untitled.chat\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users   13071 Sep 14 19:31 untitled1.chat\n\n/home/jovyan/adi_wdir/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/sf_triggers/datasets/:\ntotal 24\ndrwxr-sr-x.  4 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 19:19 .\ndrwxr-sr-x. 11 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 19:31 ..\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 18:02 .ipynb_checkpoints\n-rwxr-xr-x.  1 jovyan users    0 Sep 14 14:02 __init__.py\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 18:32 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users 6812 Sep 14 19:19 sf_triggers_dataset.py\n\n/home/jovyan/adi_wdir/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/sf_triggers/metrics/:\ntotal 20\ndrwxr-sr-x.  3 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 18:34 .\ndrwxr-sr-x. 11 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 19:31 ..\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 18:34 .ipynb_checkpoints\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users    0 Sep 14 14:02 __init__.py\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users 8124 Sep 14 14:02 sf_triggers_metrics.py",
